            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Cindy Vormittag"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made with 2 cups Half &amp; Half and 3/4 cups water, Kroger brand short brown rice. Cooked for 55 mins. Stevia extract instead of white sugar. Added 1 tsp of almond extract, also. To “build up” the sweetness that stevia lacks in depth. And sprinkled a little freshly grated nutmeg on top when serving. Made to be more diabetic friendly.",
