            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Crystal Gabri El"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a great recipe. I modified it slightly. I used a pint of left over cooked Brown rice and substituted the heavy cream for \"So delicious French vanilla coconut creamer\" and the sugar for splenda and added a dash of nutmeg. It was deliciously rich and healthy. Next time I'll find a substitute for egg yoke to make it even more healthy. Enjoy!",
