            },
            "reviewBody": "Great recipe! We used all organic ingredients &amp; I did add 1 tsp. of maple syrup with the vanilla &amp; 1 apple diced up with the raisins. We will be making this creamy, tasty dish again soon~ Thanks! Also for anyone wondering, we posted the picture... the red/orange spots are the apples : )",
